{"c":[{"id":"97ae8d03f0e99759","sum":"x","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T020832Z-18f641c9e903d593","text":"apps/caret: surface decisions (hold, retry, withdraw, work line, toast undo, Esc/Cmd-Z) live in CaretHostCore SurfaceMachine; SurfaceCoordinator only reads AppKit and draws. Test a surface change with SurfaceRig steps and a ManualClock, not on screen.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T022431Z-7481bd50921d0954","text":"apps/caret: fill decisions (proposal hold, withdraw, toast lifetime, its Cmd-Z grant) live in CaretHostCore FillMachine; FillCoordinator only reads AX and draws. Test with FillRig; the shared toast slot with SharedToastSlotTests.TwoOwners (one arbiter).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"fea98e93de0597e3","sum":"ImageRenderer draws AppKit controls (Button, Toggle, ProgressView) as placeholders: off-screen renders need SwiftUI-drawn controls, as OnboardingView does. Host test runs: pass --settings <own file> and --status-item off; --onboarding defaults off.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T024925Z-053830fa0ce54d2d","text":"SwiftUI ImageRenderer draws AppKit-backed controls (stock Button, Toggle, ProgressView) as placeholders; off-screen renders of a window need every control drawn in SwiftUI with custom styles, as Onboarding/OnboardingView does.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T024925Z-d69b7ed0397e33f9","text":"Caret host test runs: pass --settings <own file> and --status-item off; --onboarding defaults to off so a launch never puts a window up (auto opens it until finished once).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
